TeX Gyre Heros 2.004 (GUST e-foundry), a free typeface after Helvetica: the
nearest free relative of Homerton, RISC OS's desktop font (Acorn's own
Helvetica variant, not free). Copied from Fedora's texlive-tex-gyre package.
